<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύν-δετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unconnected, loose,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				169.8
			</span></i>; <i>independent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.386a
				</span></i>
			: Astrol., of signs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κριὸς πρὸς Σκορπίον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.333
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of language,
				<i>without conjunctions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Int.</u>
				17a17
			</span></i>; of style, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1413b29
			</span></i> (but ib.<i><span class="en">
				1407b38
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ μὲν συνδέσμου, μὴ ἀσύνδετα
			δέ</span> without conjunction, but not <i>without
			connexion</i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.,</span> in Rhet.,
				<i>style without conjunctions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				268
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				192
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			, al. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.16.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tib.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				40
			</span></i>.</div>
